WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.521
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:14.522 --> 00:00:17.727
I'm a skunk.

3
00:00:17.728 --> 00:00:22.343
Skunks are small mammals.

4
00:00:22.344 --> 00:00:25.261
Where do you live?

5
00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:30.025
Skunks live in North and South America.

6
00:00:30.026 --> 00:00:34.445
We like forests and mountains.

7
00:00:34.446 --> 00:00:38.540
Some skunks live in cities.

8
00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:44.134
I like your white stripes!

9
00:00:44.135 --> 00:00:48.204
A lot of skunks have stripes.

10
00:00:48.205 --> 00:00:51.473
Others have spots.

11
00:00:51.474 --> 00:00:56.033
All skunks are black and white.

12
00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:59.037
What do you eat?

13
00:00:59.038 --> 00:01:03.622
Skunks eat bugs and small animals.

14
00:01:03.623 --> 00:01:07.927
We also like plants and fruit.

15
00:01:07.928 --> 00:01:12.713
Skunks look for food at night.

16
00:01:12.714 --> 00:01:15.934
Where do you sleep?

17
00:01:15.935 --> 00:01:21.084
Skunks sleep in hollow logs or holes.

18
00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:27.266
Sometimes we sleep in other animals' homes.

19
00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:31.228
We sleep during the day.

20
00:01:31.229 --> 00:01:35.383
Do you have any enemies?

21
00:01:35.384 --> 00:01:39.973
Owls sometimes hunt us.

22
00:01:39.974 --> 00:01:44.748
But most animals stay away from us.

23
00:01:44.749 --> 00:01:50.456
Why do they stay away from you?

24
00:01:50.457 --> 00:01:54.327
Skunks can make a spray.

25
00:01:54.328 --> 00:02:01.756
We shoot enemies with the spray.

26
00:02:01.757 --> 00:02:09.855
The spray smells awful!

27
00:02:09.856 --> 00:02:14.544
Uh-oh! I see a fox.

28
00:02:14.545 --> 00:02:21.571
Stand back!

29
00:02:21.572 --> 00:02:27.577
Good-bye, Skunk!

